Description: Windows programs on Raye Linux: windows and tools
 What a Windows program shows around itself on Raye Linux: the window
 while its space is set up, the window while it is removed, the one
 that says it closed unexpectedly, and the raye-windows tool that lists
 and uninstalls installed Windows programs.
